    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Physical NES Version</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784030/extras/a4b5048eb8e0394b2d47d8c8e6f45ab0.avif?t=1736036301\" width=640 height=426 /></span><br><br>Physical versions of FIRE AND RESCUE are available at our website.<br><br>Purchase includes box, manual, and a NES cart that runs in real NES's and other compatible retro systems!</p><br><h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Authentic 8-bit era gameplay running on a real NES ROM<br></li><li> Simultaneous 2-player support<br></li><li> Score Attack and Time Attack modes<br></li><li> Steam Leaderboards and Achievements<br></li><li> Optional CRT filter for a more authetic 8-bit look</li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784030/extras/17572ad844f72e4cf85d4b80dc92f316.poster.avif?t=1736036301\" width=504 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784030/extras/17572ad844f72e4cf85d4b80dc92f316.webm?t=1736036301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784030/extras/17572ad844f72e4cf85d4b80dc92f316.mp4?t=1736036301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>We are all born equal, then a few of us become firefighters.</u></strong><br><br>Step into the boots of the brave members of the FIRE AND RESCUE team. <br><br>Fires have broken out all over the city and YOU (and maybe a friend) are the only one(s) who can save the city from being reduced to ashes! <br><br>Use your portable water tank to extinguish raging fires and carry innocent civilians to safety. <br><br>Play by yourself or simultaneously with a friend to see who is the best fire-fighter in FIRE AND RESCUE!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784030/extras/17572ad844f72e4cf85d4b80dc92f316.poster.avif?t=1736036301\" width=504 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784030/extras/17572ad844f72e4cf85d4b80dc92f316.webm?t=1736036301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784030/extras/17572ad844f72e4cf85d4b80dc92f316.mp4?t=1736036301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>We are all born equal, then a few of us become firefighters.</u></strong><br><br>Step into the boots of the brave members of the FIRE AND RESCUE team. <br><br>Fires have broken out all over the city and YOU (and maybe a friend) are the only one(s) who can save the city from being reduced to ashes! <br><br>Use your portable water tank to extinguish raging fires and carry innocent civilians to safety. <br><br>Play by yourself or simultaneously with a friend to see who is the best fire-fighter in FIRE AND RESCUE!",
